#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk stable
#: index.docbook:187
#, no-c-format
msgid "Causes &kwrite; to read the document content from STDIN. This is similar to the common option <option>-</option> used in many command line programs, and allows you to pipe command output into &kwrite;."
